---
// Giscus comments component - replaces Disqus from Hugo setup
// https://giscus.app/
//
// MIGRATION NOTE: Original Hugo site used Disqus (disqusShortname="https-ivkin-dev")
// Astro migration switched to Giscus for better GitHub integration
//
// SETUP REQUIRED (one-time):
// 1. Enable GitHub Discussions: https://github.com/evekeen/ivkin.dev/settings
//    - Go to Settings > General > Features > Check "Discussions"
// 2. Install Giscus GitHub App: https://github.com/apps/giscus
//    - Click "Install" and grant access to evekeen/ivkin.dev repository
// 3. Verify configuration at: https://giscus.app/
//    - Repository: evekeen/ivkin.dev
//    - Category: General (or create a new category in Discussions)
//
// Current Configuration:
// - Repository ID: R_kgDOMwdTVw
// - Category: General
// - Category ID: DIC_kwDOMwdTVw
// - Mapping: pathname (each page URL gets its own discussion)
---

<div class="giscus-wrapper mt-24 pt-16 border-t border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800">
  <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-8 text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Comments</h3>

  <div id="giscus-container">
    <script
      src="https://giscus.app/client.js"
      data-repo="evekeen/ivkin.dev"
      data-repo-id="R_kgDOMwdTVw"
      data-category="General"
      data-category-id="DIC_kwDOMwdTVw"
      data-mapping="pathname"
      data-strict="0"
      data-reactions-enabled="1"
      data-emit-metadata="0"
      data-input-position="top"
      data-theme="preferred_color_scheme"
      data-lang="en"
      data-loading="lazy"
      crossorigin="anonymous"
      async>
    </script>
  </div>

  <noscript>
    <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
      Please enable JavaScript to view comments.
    </p>
  </noscript>
</div>

<style>
  :global(.giscus, .giscus-frame) {
    width: 100%;
  }
</style>
